			"notes": "- Broken items stop producing new active or passive effects, including item callbacks, equipment attributes and enchantments. Existing timed effects expire normally.\n- Repair broken items using an anvil, crafting or a grindstone, following normal Minecraft repair rules.\n- Preserve complete original-item snapshots when saving and transferring broken items, and protect them from ordinary recipe consumption.\n- Uninstalling Keep My Sword leaves vanilla recovery compasses containing the original item data. Reinstall the mod to display and repair those items again.\n\nRequires RinLib 1.0.2. Available for Minecraft 1.21.1, 26.1.2 and 26.2 on Fabric and NeoForge."
		},
